        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Called them once to get a quote for powering up a heatpump. Left a voicemail - zero response. Called again 2 days later - they dropped my call after the 2nd ring. Filled out a contact form on their website - still ZERO response. I guess they don't need my business , or yours. Stay away !",
        "time": 1655430783,
